  "source": {
    "kind": "bench",
    "repro": "node website/scripts/cancel-mechanism-bench.ts --runs=3",
    "notes": "A real Chrome worker (linux) filling a 100k-cell Float32Array 4000 times, consulting its cancellation once per pass. Cancel rows abort from the main thread 333, 640 and 1100 ms in, three stops per run; overrun is how long the loop ran past the stop. Unit costs on the same page: one synchronous blob-URL probe 0.86 ms, one createObjectURL+revoke pair 99 µs."
